e Trash, and the Holder!\n\nCo-op Multiplayer\nShare a puzzle with a friend! Double the fun, but double the challenge!\n\nCompetitive Multiplayer\nWhen it's time to show your skills!\n\nCampaign mode\nBecome the Vetrix Worlds champion by completing many challenges all across the world!\n\nFour Arcade modes\nTime Attack - Reach the target score as fast as possible.\nHigh Score - Reach the highest score possible in 5 minutes.\nSurvival mode - Play as long as you can.\nFree mode \u2013 No time constraints, just relax and enjoy the ride.\n\nOnline Leaderboards\nYour friends should know who's the best!", "short_description": "The critically acclaimed Tetris-inspired VR Puzzle game is back with a feature-packed sequel!\nEnjoy the game alone with our Arcade and Campaign modes, or get social with our all-new Co-op and Competitive Multiplayer Online modes.\nTime to scratch that OCD itch of yours!"}]}, "developer_name": "Vagabond", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vagabond.games/PrivacyPolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "N/A", "support_website_url": "https://vagabond.games/", "website_url": "https://vagabond.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1132197920894592"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "779620506842245"}]},